    "created_by": "leonardmarcq",
    "output": "Congratulations on launching your startup! Scaling quickly can be challenging but exciting. Here are a few tips that might help:\n\n1. **Focus on Your Product-Market Fit**: Make sure you're solving a real problem that customers care about. Gather feedback and iterate your product accordingly.\n\n2. **Leverage Technology**: Use automation tools to streamline operations, marketing, and customer service. This will free up your time to focus on growth strategies.\n\n3. **Build a Strong Team**: Hire individuals who share your vision and bring diverse skill sets. A dedicated team can drive your growth effectively.\n\n4. **Expand Your Marketing Efforts**: Utilize digital marketing strategies—social media, SEO, and content marketing are all great ways to reach a wider audience.\n\n5. **Network and Collaborate**: Connect with industry peers and potential partners. Collaborations can open doors to new opportunities and resources.\n\n6. **Consider Funding Options**: If needed, look into venture capital, angel investors, or crowdfunding to gain the resources necessary to expand quickly.\n\nGood luck with your startup!",
    "source": {
